# Since 2026-10-03 (#532, ADR 0006 amendment) the shipper merges every pull
# request whose required verdicts pass at head. Lexema's own rule files
# (.decisions/, AGENTS.md, .fabrika.jsonc, the design manifest) are no longer
# listed here; they stay gated by the required governance verdict
# (`governedRoots` in .fabrika.jsonc). Huey can still hold any pull request
# with the `ready-for:human` label.
#
# Fabrika's fixed control-plane boundary (fabrika-cli) still names these
# paths, and its codeowners-cp guard requires them owned, so changes to
# workflows, agent settings and git hooks still need Huey's sign-off.
/.claude/                   @hueypov
/.github/                   @hueypov
**/lefthook*                @hueypov
**/.lefthook*               @hueypov

# Fabrika's control-plane list is fixed in fabrika-cli and names its own
# paths. Lexema has none of these yet. The rows keep `fabrika guard
# codeowners-cp check` green (#338) and cover the paths if they ever appear.
/.claude-plugin/                @hueypov
/packages/ci-required/          @hueypov
/packages/fabrika-cli/src/ci/   @hueypov
/biome.jsonc                    @hueypov
/biome-plugins/                 @hueypov
